    imported source pin; no Lean file was edited and no Lean build was run.

    <item>No literature result was used; this chapter concerns
    source-specific finite responses and scale recurrences, not an
    independent theorem from the literature.

    <item><verbatim|git diff --check> passed with no output.

    <item><verbatim|python3 scripts/check_blueprint.py> was run but could not
    complete: this clone lacks <verbatim|blueprint/units/YM-000026/unit.json>.
    The failure is environmental and does not certify the evidence record.

    <item>No LaTeX build or visual inspection has been run for this new
    section.

    <item>Subsequently inspected <verbatim|Croissant.toast>,
    <verbatim|Bakery.Yeast>, <verbatim|Caprese.baking>, and
    <verbatim|Strudel.filling> to expose their terminal and finite root-test
    use. After the final correction pass, <verbatim|git diff --check> was
    rerun and passed with no output. No Lean build or LaTeX build was run.
  </itemize-minus>

